  "body": "Just want to start an issue to track performance concerns vs Node/IO.js streams implementations. I know that streams are currently a major bottleneck in performing IO and would be curious to see if we can make a benchmark and at least ensure we can reach performance parity. Having a nice API is one thing, but if we lose performance doing it we will be in trouble.\n",
